    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104413" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσαυτα-πλάσιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πλᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>so many fold, so many times</i> or <i>so much
			more,</i> corresponding to relat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁσαπλάσιος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				917b23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				929b14
			</span></i>; <i>the same multiple as,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archim.
				<u>Sph.Cyl.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσαυτα-πλᾰσίων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aequil.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Theo Sm.
			</span></i> P.<i><span class="en">
				76H.
			</span></i></div>
